<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Leaving</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 8)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast leaving &lt;direction&gt;
cast leaving north    (or n, e, sw, up, ...)
</pre>
<p>The caster utters 'Quis pesat' and vanishes, to appear in the next room in 
the direction given. It can be cast in the middle of a fight, so it is a 
way out when fleeing would be too slow or too risky: you go where you 
choose, not where you stumble.
</p><p>The way must be open: a closed door stops it, and so does water that only a 
boat can cross. Some clan halls are guarded against it. If the spell fails, 
nothing happens, and you are still where you were. It is also found on 
wands, scrolls and staffs.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fleeing</a>
